      "title": "How light affects seedling growth",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Student: Avery Kim    Class: Year 7 Science    Teacher: Jo Lee    Date: 21 June 2027"
        },
        {
          "type": "h",
          "text": "Question and prediction"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "How does daily light exposure affect bean seedling height over two weeks? I predict that the group receiving more light will show healthier leaf growth. Height alone may not capture plant health."
        },
        {
          "type": "h",
          "text": "Variables"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "Type",
            "What is measured or controlled"
